{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0029-s002", "text": "Det är ändå vanligt att en familj består av bara två vuxna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T014600029158Z/hb-c09-u0029-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.572789115646258, "peak": 0.2413330078125, "generation_seconds": 17.924302180064842, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0029-s003", "text": "Alla par vill inte ha barn, och många är nöjda med sitt liv utan barn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T014600029158Z/hb-c09-u0029-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.130068027210885, "peak": 0.425201416015625, "generation_seconds": 15.796426985878497, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0030-s001", "text": "En del par får inga barn, även om de skulle vilja.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T014600029158Z/hb-c09-u0030-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.667210884353741, "peak": 0.247711181640625, "generation_seconds": 9.8725800300017, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0030-s002", "text": "För dem finns det fertilitetsbehandlingar som ökar sannolikheten att bli gravid och få barn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T014600029158Z/hb-c09-u0030-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.325714111328125, "generation_seconds": 15.57107458380051, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0030-s003", "text": "Par kan också överväga att adoptera ett barn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T014600029158Z/hb-c09-u0030-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.31891156462585, "peak": 0.370819091796875, "generation_seconds": 8.926977407885715, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0030-s004", "text": "Ett adoptivbarn är biologiskt sett någon annans barn, men genom adoption, det vill säga att personen blir att betrakta som barn till de som adopterar, får hen nya föräldrar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T014600029158Z/hb-c09-u0030-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 14.419591836734694, "peak": 0.398193359375, "generation_seconds": 28.251308244187385, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0030-s005", "text": "I Finland adopteras barn ofta från utlandet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T014600029158Z/hb-c09-u0030-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.179591836734694, "peak": 0.308349609375, "generation_seconds": 8.330253018066287, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0030-s006", "text": "Adoptionsprocessen är fastställd i lag.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T014600029158Z/hb-c09-u0030-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.9706122448979593, "peak": 0.3446044921875, "generation_seconds": 8.36864623380825, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0030-s007", "text": "Den börjar med en lagstadgad adoptionsrådgivning, där familjens livssituation kartläggs.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T014807638310Z/hb-c09-u0030-s007.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.283721923828125, "generation_seconds": 14.890588814858347, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0031-s001", "text": "Man kan erbjuda ett barn eller en ung person ett hem också genom att bli familjehemsförälder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T014807638310Z/hb-c09-u0031-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.9412244897959186, "peak": 0.2677001953125, "generation_seconds": 14.24427450611256, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0031-s002", "text": "En familjehemsförälder öppnar sitt hem för ett barn som det av någon orsak inte är tryggt för att bo hos sina föräldrar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T014807638310Z/hb-c09-u0031-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.309659863945578, "peak": 0.259979248046875, "generation_seconds": 18.350800935178995, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0031-s003", "text": "Barnet tas om hand av familjehemsföräldrarna tills vidare, ibland tills hen blir myndig.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T014807638310Z/hb-c09-u0031-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.9412244897959186, "peak": 0.286773681640625, "generation_seconds": 15.642826115014032, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0032-s001", "text": "När det finns barn i en familj men bara en vuxen, pratar man om en familj med en förälder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T014807638310Z/hb-c09-u0032-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.25787353515625, "generation_seconds": 13.755968865938485, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0032-s002", "text": "En ensamförsörjare är i allmänhet skild, änka eller änkling.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T014807638310Z/hb-c09-u0032-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.642448979591837, "peak": 0.32366943359375, "generation_seconds": 10.159786822041497, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0032-s003", "text": "Ibland har ensamförsörjaren skaffat barn på egen hand, det vill säga familjen har alltid bestått av bara en förälder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T014807638310Z/hb-c09-u0032-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.24, "peak": 0.30096435546875, "generation_seconds": 17.53182127699256, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0032-s004", "text": "Kvinnor som bor ensamma kan i Finland få fertilitetsbehandling med spermier utan make.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T014807638310Z/hb-c09-u0032-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.453605442176871, "peak": 0.248260498046875, "generation_seconds": 12.20103092584759, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0033-s001", "text": "I familjer med en förälder bor en förälder med barnen utan make eller maka.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015019733350Z/hb-c09-u0033-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.408707482993197, "peak": 0.422027587890625, "generation_seconds": 8.799590521026403, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0033-s002", "text": "Föräldern kan då ha antingen ensam eller gemensam vårdnad om barnet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015019733350Z/hb-c09-u0033-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.060408163265306, "peak": 0.274871826171875, "generation_seconds": 9.120858970098197, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0033-s003", "text": "Som ensamstående förälder har man själv ansvaret för fostran av barnet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015019733350Z/hb-c09-u0033-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.826666666666667, "peak": 0.31134033203125, "generation_seconds": 11.494691508123651, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0033-s004", "text": "Om föräldrarna däremot har gemensam vårdnad (yhteishuoltaja) kommer föräldrarna tillsammans överens om barnets angelägenheter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015019733350Z/hb-c09-u0033-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.284897959183674, "peak": 0.289276123046875, "generation_seconds": 18.35482602310367, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0034-s001", "text": "Det kan vara utmanande för en ensamförsörjare att kombinera barnomsorg och förvärvsarbete.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015019733350Z/hb-c09-u0034-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.257598876953125, "generation_seconds": 11.659515884937719, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0034-s002", "text": "Den ekonomiska situationen kan vara tuff, och det kan ibland vara psykiskt tungt att ensam ta hand om ett barn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015019733350Z/hb-c09-u0034-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.543401360544218, "peak": 0.27520751953125, "generation_seconds": 15.337853729957715, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0034-s003", "text": "Finska staten stöder ensamförsörjare, så att familjerna med en förälder inte ska vara i en svagare ställning än andra.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015019733350Z/hb-c09-u0034-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.65795918367347, "peak": 0.3509521484375, "generation_seconds": 18.31448292406276, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0034-s004", "text": "Till exempel en del av FPA:s stöd innehåller ett ensamförsörjartillägg, det vill säga stödet för familjer med en förälder är lite högre än för familjer med två föräldrar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015019733350Z/hb-c09-u0034-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 15.603809523809524, "peak": 0.28369140625, "generation_seconds": 24.607965206960216, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0035-s001", "text": "I Finland är det vanligt att människor som skilt sig hittar en ny partner, flyttar ihop och ofta också gifter sig på nytt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015232351458Z/hb-c09-u0035-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.518639455782314, "peak": 0.261199951171875, "generation_seconds": 16.9417392751202, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0035-s002", "text": "Med bonusfamilj avses en familj där det finns barn från den ena eller båda föräldrarnas tidigare förhållanden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015232351458Z/hb-c09-u0035-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.682721088435374, "peak": 0.31683349609375, "generation_seconds": 16.190111922100186, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0035-s003", "text": "I en bonusfamilj kan det också finnas gemensamma barn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015232351458Z/hb-c09-u0035-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.876190476190477, "peak": 0.235382080078125, "generation_seconds": 8.642167063895613, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0035-s004", "text": "Ofta kan barnen i en bonusfamilj ha två hem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015232351458Z/hb-c09-u0035-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.9706122448979593, "peak": 0.274017333984375, "generation_seconds": 6.812298853881657, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0035-s005", "text": "Då bor barnen hos den andra föräldern en del av tiden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015232351458Z/hb-c09-u0035-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.320556640625, "generation_seconds": 8.281683127162978, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0036-s001", "text": "I Finland kallas familjer med personer som hör till en sexuell minoritet eller en könsminoritet för regnbågsfamiljer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015232351458Z/hb-c09-u0036-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.170340136054422, "peak": 0.246826171875, "generation_seconds": 16.97077461378649, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0036-s002", "text": "Regnbågen är en symbol för sexuella minoriteter och könsminoriteter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015232351458Z/hb-c09-u0036-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.199727891156463, "peak": 0.2703857421875, "generation_seconds": 10.660020616836846, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0036-s003", "text": "Det finns olika slags regnbågsfamiljer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015232351458Z/hb-c09-u0036-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.622312925170068, "peak": 0.4176025390625, "generation_seconds": 6.540394311072305, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0036-s004", "text": "I en familj kan det finnas till exempel två mammor och barn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015415314766Z/hb-c09-u0036-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.294149659863946, "peak": 0.264617919921875, "generation_seconds": 9.984095552004874, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0037-s001", "text": "Regnbågsfamiljer får barn på olika sätt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015415314766Z/hb-c09-u0037-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.8312925170068026, "peak": 0.25677490234375, "generation_seconds": 8.31271060789004, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0037-s002", "text": "I Finland kan också lesbiska par få fertilitetsbehandlingar med donerade spermier.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015415314766Z/hb-c09-u0037-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.314285714285714, "peak": 0.25115966796875, "generation_seconds": 14.938516115071252, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0037-s003", "text": "Den ena makan kan ha barn från ett tidigare förhållande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015415314766Z/hb-c09-u0037-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.876190476190477, "peak": 0.27606201171875, "generation_seconds": 10.620188183849677, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0037-s004", "text": "Man kan också få barn med till exempel en vän eller ett annat par så att fler än två vuxna deltar i barnets uppfostran.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015415314766Z/hb-c09-u0037-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.170340136054422, "peak": 0.358001708984375, "generation_seconds": 20.491726121865213, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0038-s001", "text": "I Finland har det länge arbetats för att sexuella minoriteter och regnbågsfamiljer ska ha samma rättigheter som familjer som består av en man och en kvinna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015415314766Z/hb-c09-u0038-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.305034013605443, "peak": 0.298370361328125, "generation_seconds": 25.34164132992737, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0038-s002", "text": "Människornas attityder har så småningom blivit mer accepterande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015415314766Z/hb-c09-u0038-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.7817687074829935, "peak": 0.3519287109375, "generation_seconds": 11.536194407148287, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0038-s003", "text": "Den jämställda äktenskapslagen som trädde i kraft år 2017 har förbättrat rättigheterna för regnbågsfamiljer och de barn som lever i sådana inför lagen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015415314766Z/hb-c09-u0038-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 14.280272108843537, "peak": 0.354034423828125, "generation_seconds": 28.333104446996003, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0039-s001", "text": "Föräldrapartnerskap innebär att två personer beslutar sig för att bli föräldrar tillsammans utan att vara i ett parförhållande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015640222480Z/hb-c09-u0039-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.00625850340136, "peak": 0.365203857421875, "generation_seconds": 24.377885167021304, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0039-s002", "text": "Barnet bor ofta turvist hos båda föräldrarna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015640222480Z/hb-c09-u0039-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.249251700680272, "peak": 0.280548095703125, "generation_seconds": 9.216701311059296, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0040-s001", "text": "Ibland har föräldrapartnerna varit vänner redan innan de bestämmer sig för att bli föräldrar tillsammans.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015640222480Z/hb-c09-u0040-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.195102040816327, "peak": 0.308624267578125, "generation_seconds": 19.238801869098097, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0040-s002", "text": "Ibland söker personer som bor ensamma och som vill ha barn å andra sidan avsiktligt efter en annan person i samma situation.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015640222480Z/hb-c09-u0040-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.727619047619047, "peak": 0.35491943359375, "generation_seconds": 22.076979218050838, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0040-s003", "text": "Tanken är inte att hitta en romantisk partner, utan endast att uppfostra ett barn tillsammans.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015640222480Z/hb-c09-u0040-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.289523809523809, "peak": 0.304840087890625, "generation_seconds": 12.51794853201136, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0040-s004", "text": "Föräldrapartnerskap är ännu ganska ovanligt, men en familjeform som blivit lite vanligare på senare tid.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015640222480Z/hb-c09-u0040-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.264761904761905, "peak": 0.304931640625, "generation_seconds": 14.824215248925611, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0041-s001", "text": "Det är vanligt att till exempel studerande bor själva i små enrummare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015640222480Z/hb-c09-u0041-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.259429931640625, "generation_seconds": 9.923944318899885, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0041-s002", "text": "Förut var det vanligare att studerande bodde i gemensamma bostäder, där de delade kök och badrum med andra boende.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015640222480Z/hb-c09-u0041-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.752380952380953, "peak": 0.285369873046875, "generation_seconds": 14.492246367968619, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0041-s003", "text": "En del väljer ändå att flytta ihop med kompisar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015902255534Z/hb-c09-u0041-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.388571428571429, "peak": 0.324188232421875, "generation_seconds": 6.725496407132596, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0041-s004", "text": "Att dela lägenhet kan till exempel göra det möjligt att bo i ett bostadsområde där det skulle vara för dyrt att bo på egen hand.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015902255534Z/hb-c09-u0041-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.379319727891156, "peak": 0.29742431640625, "generation_seconds": 15.844304822850972, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0041-s005", "text": "Det ger också de boende en känsla av gemenskap.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015902255534Z/hb-c09-u0041-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.31891156462585, "peak": 0.23828125, "generation_seconds": 6.272834161994979, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0042-s001", "text": "Förutom unga bor också vuxna som inte har någon partner eller hemmaboende barn ensamma.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015902255534Z/hb-c09-u0042-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.273590087890625, "generation_seconds": 11.173042122041807, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0042-s002", "text": "I synnerhet äldre kvinnor bor ofta själva efter att deras make dött.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015902255534Z/hb-c09-u0042-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.130068027210885, "peak": 0.2349853515625, "generation_seconds": 9.10016569099389, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0042-s003", "text": "Även om en person bor ensam, har hen i allmänhet närstående, till exempel föräldrar, vuxna barn, andra släktingar eller viktiga vänner.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015902255534Z/hb-c09-u0042-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.77251700680272, "peak": 0.482330322265625, "generation_seconds": 19.825017797062173, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0042-s004", "text": "Att bo själv kan också vara förknippat med ensamhet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015902255534Z/hb-c09-u0042-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.3131103515625, "generation_seconds": 9.014541720040143, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0043-s001", "text": "Gifta makar av samma kön har rätt att adoptera ett barn och rätt till adoption inom familjen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T015902255534Z/hb-c09-u0043-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.289523809523809, "peak": 0.29632568359375, "generation_seconds": 14.46046939608641, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0043-s002", "text": "Adoption inom familjen betyder att makan/maken adopterar sin makas/makes barn och blir officiellt barnets andra förälder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T020046697352Z/hb-c09-u0043-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.309659863945578, "peak": 0.350494384765625, "generation_seconds": 15.60965591808781, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0043-s003", "text": "I Finland kan ett barn ha högst två juridiska föräldrar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjeformer/narration-resume-20261103T020046697352Z/hb-c09-u0043-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.264984130859375, "generation_seconds": 7.607328591868281, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
